#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:1
msgid "Using the `post-build-hook`"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:3
msgid "Implementation Caveats"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:5
msgid ""
"Here we use the post-build hook to upload to a binary cache. This is a "
"simple and working example, but it is not suitable for all use cases."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:8
msgid ""
"The post build hook program runs after each executed build, and blocks the "
"build loop. The build loop exits if the hook program fails."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:11
msgid ""
"Concretely, this implementation will make Nix slow or unusable when the "
"internet is slow or unreliable."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:14
msgid ""
"A more advanced implementation might pass the store paths to a user-supplied "
"daemon or queue for processing the store paths outside of the build loop."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:18
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:20
msgid ""
"This tutorial assumes you have configured an [S3-compatible binary cache](../"
"command-ref/new-cli/nix3-help-stores.md#s3-binary-cache-store) as a "
"[substituter](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-substituters), and that the "
"`root` user's default AWS profile can upload to the bucket."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:23
msgid "Set up a Signing Key"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:25
msgid ""
"Use `nix-store --generate-binary-cache-key` to create our public and private "
"signing keys. We will sign paths with the private key, and distribute the "
"public key for verifying the authenticity of the paths."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:35
msgid ""
"Then update [`nix.conf`](../command-ref/conf-file.md) on any machine that "
"will access the cache. Add the cache URL to [`substituters`](../command-ref/"
"conf-file.md#conf-substituters) and the public key to [`trusted-public-keys`]"
"(../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-trusted-public-keys):"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:38
msgid ""
"    substituters = https://cache.nixos.org/ s3://example-nix-cache\n"
"    trusted-public-keys = cache.nixos."
"org-1:6NCHdD59X431o0gWypbMrAURkbJ16ZPMQFGspcDShjY= example-nix-cache-1:1/"
"cKDz3QCCOmwcztD2eV6Coggp6rqc9DGjWv7C0G+rM=\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:41
msgid ""
"Machines that build for the cache must sign derivations using the private "
"key. On those machines, add the path to the key file to the [`secret-key-"
"files`](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-secret-key-files) field in their "
"[`nix.conf`](../command-ref/conf-file.md):"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:46
msgid "We will restart the Nix daemon in a later step."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:48
msgid "Implementing the build hook"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:50
msgid "Write the following script to `/etc/nix/upload-to-cache.sh`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:53
msgid "#!/bin/sh\n"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:56
msgid "# disable globbing\n"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:57
msgid "' '"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:59
msgid "\"Uploading paths\""
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:60
msgid "\"s3://example-nix-cache\""
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:63
msgid "**Note**"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:65
msgid ""
"The `$OUT_PATHS` variable is a space-separated list of Nix store paths. In "
"this case, we expect and want the shell to perform word splitting to make "
"each output path its own argument to `nix store sign`. Nix guarantees the "
"paths will not contain any spaces, however a store path might contain glob "
"characters. The `set -f` disables globbing in the shell. If you want to "
"upload the `.drv` file too, the `$DRV_PATH` variable is also defined for the "
"script and works just like `$OUT_PATHS`."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:74
msgid "Then make sure the hook program is executable by the `root` user:"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:80
msgid "Updating Nix Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:82
msgid ""
"Edit `/etc/nix/nix.conf` to run our hook, by adding the following "
"configuration snippet at the end:"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:87
msgid "Then, restart the `nix-daemon`."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:89
msgid "Testing"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:91
msgid "Build any derivation, for example:"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:93
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix-build --expr '(import <nixpkgs> {}).writeText \"example\" (builtins."
"toString builtins.currentTime)'\n"
"this derivation will be built:\n"
"  /nix/store/s4pnfbkalzy5qz57qs6yybna8wylkig6-example.drv\n"
"building '/nix/store/s4pnfbkalzy5qz57qs6yybna8wylkig6-example.drv'...\n"
"running post-build-hook '/home/grahamc/projects/github.com/NixOS/nix/post-"
"hook.sh'...\n"
"post-build-hook: Signing paths /nix/store/ibcyipq5gf91838ldx40mjsp0b8w9n18-"
"example\n"
"post-build-hook: Uploading paths /nix/store/ibcyipq5gf91838ldx40mjsp0b8w9n18-"
"example\n"
"/nix/store/ibcyipq5gf91838ldx40mjsp0b8w9n18-example\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:104
msgid ""
"Then delete the path from the store, and try substituting it from the binary "
"cache:"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:112
msgid "Now, copy the path back from the cache:"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:114
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix-store --realise /nix/store/ibcyipq5gf91838ldx40mjsp0b8w9n18-example\n"
"copying path '/nix/store/m8bmqwrch6l3h8s0k3d673xpmipcdpsa-example from 's3://"
"example-nix-cache'...\n"
"warning: you did not specify '--add-root'; the result might be removed by "
"the garbage collector\n"
"/nix/store/m8bmqwrch6l3h8s0k3d673xpmipcdpsa-example\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:121
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:123
msgid ""
"We now have a Nix installation configured to automatically sign and upload "
"every local build to a remote binary cache."
msgstr ""

#: source/advanced-topics/post-build-hook.md:126
msgid ""
"Before deploying this to production, be sure to consider the [implementation "
"caveats](#implementation-caveats)."
msgstr ""
